**M00.DecodeHeader:** Independent implementation and production upgrade acceptance; decoding is not admission.

**M00.DecodeTransaction:** No nonce reservation or balance authority from decoded bytes.

**M01.VerifyWork:** Fastest-adversary work cost, independent cross-hardware qualification, public ingress fairness and ordinary product integration remain unqualified; source-bound diagnostics are not current timing receipts.

**M01.VerifyTransactionSignature:** Component signature parity does not establish independent cryptographic acceptance.

**M02.AdmitBlock:** Open public P2P, production mining/mempool lifecycle, incremental durable state, physical power-loss, ordinary Hepta resource/effect integration and independent work acceptance remain unqualified. Native confirmation remains full-history and local-observation scoped.

**M02.ChooseBranch:** Open public P2P, production mining/mempool lifecycle, incremental durable state, physical power-loss, ordinary Hepta resource/effect integration and independent work acceptance remain unqualified. Native confirmation remains full-history and local-observation scoped.

**M03.RunWorkAttempt:** Open public P2P, production mining/mempool lifecycle, full-state and history cost bounds, physical power-loss, ordinary Hepta resource/effect integration and independent work acceptance remain unqualified. Native confirmation remains full-history and local-observation scoped.

**M03.EnterExternalEffect:** Entry is not actual dispatch, target-side exactly-once, final-use authority or coherent rollback protection.

**M04.ReadFrame:** No confidentiality, peer discovery, open gossip, Sybil fairness, WAN qualification or public service acceptance.

**M04.PropagateVerifiedBlock:** Allowlisted same-owner development delivery is not open discovery, independent operation, WAN liveness or public attack acceptance.

**M04.AuthenticateRequest:** Authentication supplies identity/integrity/replay control only; confidentiality, permissionless identity, public fairness and independent operators remain absent.

**M05.ValidateTransaction:** Full-prefix decoding and state-dependent gates, complete output roots, SQL/lock costs, ordinary peer event wiring and public service acceptance remain separately scoped.

**M05.ReconsiderAfterReorg:** Explicit local pool/status/miner callers are implemented; automatic external event consumption, ordinary product integration, public fairness and physical-effect reconciliation remain unqualified. Source bindings do not assert a fresh executed receipt.

**M06.ExecuteCandidate:** Derived execution caches remain disposable; explicitly selected native authenticated commitments have their own checked persistent authority. Full-State execution and non-account scans remain, without a partial-State verifier or global incremental cost guarantee. Default Node storage is unchanged; ordinary product integration, public service and physical power-loss acceptance remain open. Revision16 is a bounded three-expert development family, not arbitrary Hepta topology; controlled new-text windows do not establish independent prospective utility or data governance.

